WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:41.970
<i>The evil hands of Devimon
reached for Yamato's brother Takeru.</i>

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:47.770
<i>Amid the fierce battle,</i>

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:51.230
<i>Taichi and the others witnessed
the Holy Digimon's powers.</i>

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:01.740
<i>After a brief encounter,
the Holy Digimon turned into a Digitama.</i>

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.910
<i>And just when they thought
it would fall into Takeru's hands...</i>

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:29.140
Who are you? And what are you
gonna do with the Digitama?!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.910
That was close.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.050
Is that one of Devimon's henchmen too?

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.060
That's what our reports say.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:08.060
Skullknightmon.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:08.810
SKULLKNIGHTMON

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:11.560
Aside from that name,
we don't know much else.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:11.560
DARKMAILDRAMON

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:12.690
Gabumon!

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:13.560
Okay!

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:15.980
Gabumon Evolution!

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.150
Garurumon!

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.700
Anyhow, we'll follow Skullknightmon!

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.780
We'll catch up
after we regroup with Leomon.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.580
We're counting on you!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:38.440
THE TIDE-TURNING UPDATE

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:48.010
This is the same as that dark swamp
we saw before, huh?

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.770
Yeah, but it looks more gloopy.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.230
Um, Yamato.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.360
Not now, Takeru.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.690
We'll talk later.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:02.900
Okay!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:09.200
A... tower?

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:13.920
Oh! Skullknightmon's going inside!

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.090
We were too late.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:23.340
Looks like...

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:27.010
we've come to a really crazy place.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:33.060
Yeah, the miasma is unnaturally dense.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:35.400
Takeru!

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:37.360
What's wrong?

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.940
I found this on the ground here.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:45.070
The Holy Digimon's feather...

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.910
The Holy Digimon
escaped this place to save us,

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:52.120
and gave everything for us.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.670
This must be location
that Orgemon said was straight ahead!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:05.590
This is the destination
we've been looking for.

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:11.890
But how are we going to get up there?

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.840
SPLASHMON

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:46.340
The miasma became a Digimon!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.350
Fox Fire!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.240
Takeru!

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.200
Agumon!

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:13.620
Agumon Evolution!

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:15.660
Greymon!

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.030
Stay hidden.

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:28.610
Weregarurumon!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:40.330
So the swamp of miasma
is the power source...

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.970
Looks like the car's ready.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:44.100
Mimi, why don't you stay home
and relax for a day?

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:45.900
I did!

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:49.360
I had a warm bath,
a comfy bed to sleep in,

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.400
and even a tasty breakfast!

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.150
Huh? Isn't that normal?

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.410
Yeah, but...

00:08:56.030 --> 00:09:00.160
Anyhow, I gotta go do
what I can right now!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:01.870
I'll be going now!

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.550
Mom was pretty angry.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.010
Oh, hey...

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.680
You ran away for three days,
ditched cram school,

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.350
and lost your study book.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.310
Can't believe you did all that.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:26.600
That's...

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:29.400
because I have something to do.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:30.320
Here.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:32.570
A runaway pack.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:33.440
Huh?

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.360
I don't know what's going on...

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.870
but do it to your heart's content,
little brother!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.750
W-What?

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:53.920
They're both on their way.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:54.800
All right.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:57.090
Sora-san, here.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.220
<i>Sora!</i>

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:02.760
<i>Can you see me?</i>

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.770
Wow! How'd you do it?

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.770
I updated the Digivice.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:11.860
It's limited to your partner,
but now you can communicate any--

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.270
<i>Koshiro-san!</i>

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.740
<i>There's big trouble over here!</i>

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:24.490
CALAMARAMON

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.960
How creepy! Why's there so many?!

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.790
No wonder communication was jammed.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.230
What's going on?

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:58.900
<i>That one's controlling
the surrounding Digimons!</i>

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:05.700
That Digimon's name is...
Ca... la... ma... ra... mon.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.700
Calamaramon!

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:24.600
What system is the target?

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.020
The Strait of Malacca?

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.640
Hey, look!

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.400
We can't steer! We've lost control!

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:43.030
Switch the system to manual!

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.780
It's no use! It won't accept any commands!

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.080
What?!

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.330
We're going to crash
into the harbor at this rate!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.170
Large ships use a system called AIS

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.960
to communicate
with port authorities at all times.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:01.880
<i>They broke into the system
through that data!</i>

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:03.550
<i>Can't we stop this?</i>

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:08.010
<i>The only way is to defeat those Digimon
as fast as we can!</i>

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.660
Hup... hup...

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:34.680
Metalgreymon!

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.900
Kaiser Nail!

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:49.570
Giga Destroyer!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:52.950
All right!

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:58.460
What?!

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.430
Gabumon!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.800
Metalgreymon!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.430
What...

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.360
is that?

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:31.930
Huh?

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.750
Metalgreymon...

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:09.960
Taichi!

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:31.070
Taichi...

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:37.580
Taichi...

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:50.710
To take back the Holy Digimon
and to save our world...

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:54.220
<i>That's why we came all the way here!</i>

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:01.930
We can't give up at a place like this!

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.980
Right, Metalgreymon?!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:51.610
Metalgreymon overcame the miasma's poison
and turned it into new power!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.840
Bust through it!

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:42.660
Agumon!

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:46.660
We did it!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.080
Yeah, Taichi.

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.050
What's that?!

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:59.880
Yamato!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:00.800
Whoa!

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:02.050
Takeru!

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:04.890
You okay?

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:05.770
Yeah!

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:07.770
This is...

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.830
ELDORADIMON

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.860
So this is the castle's entrance.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:57.270
Takeru, you did this?

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.360
Yeah!

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.490
Way to go, Takeru.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.120
Yeah.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:06.990
All right.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.160
Let's go!

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.870
Magical Fire!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:22.380
There's too many!

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:25.890
We must get that Calamaramon
or nothing will change!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.300
All right!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.480
Okay!

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:38.570
An evolution!

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:41.030
Could that be...

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:45.030
I knew it! The Digimon from before!

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:46.740
Algomon!

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:47.990
You know that thing?

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:49.030
Yes.

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:53.000
It's dangerous to let them keep evolving!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:57.130
I can't believe Calamaramon
is controlling these!

00:20:58.630 --> 00:20:59.960
Don't tell me...

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:03.300
<i>Are they trying to crash
the tanker into the city?!</i>

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:31.390 --> 00:22:33.010
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.310 --> 00:22:35.600
<i>Metalgreymon.</i>

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:39.020
<i>Greymon super evolves
into this Ultimate Digimon.</i>

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:39.020
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:41.190
TYPE: CYBORG

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:43.270
<i>A super destructive attack is launched
from Metalgreymon's iron body.</i>

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:43.270
SPECIAL MOVE:
GIGA DESTROYER / GIGA STORM

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:45.110
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.280 --> 00:22:48.200
<i>Metalgreymon's right arm is bare
for some reason.</i>

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:53.240
<i>This isn't by mistake! It was actually
kept bare for this awesome move!</i>

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:55.790
<i>Maybe Kabuterimon's hiding something too.</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:22:59.920
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:03.500
<i>Takeru and Yamato are in danger.</i>

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:07.340
<i>That's when Weregarurumon's roar
echoes into the sky.</i>

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:11.800
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Unbeatable Blue Sagittarius"</i>

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:14.470
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
